    "functionality": "Moved out of the data: the usable-from-damage parameter set the assembly binds (policy.closed-at-extensive) states it.",
    "length_km": "Great-circle distance between a link's end nodes; the dataset gives no lengths.",
    "capacity": "The dataset's highest capacity state per arc (unitless capacity levels).",
    "bridge_location": "Each bridge sits at the midpoint of its link's end nodes; bridge locations are not surveyed."
